    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "KM PROPERTY are delighted to present to the market No. 8 Rutland Cottages. Placed in a quiet cul de sac, this charming one-bedroom cottage offers a blank canvas to parties considering trading down locally, first time buyers or investors. This space is further enhanced by a south facing, low maintenance rear garden. \n\nViewing video https://youtu.be/lBY_1YlnnCY\n\nA standout feature is the exceptionally spacious living, kitchen and dining room, complete with a striking double-height ceiling that enhances the sense of light and openness. Steps lead down into this inviting living area, with smart under-stair storage seamlessly integrated. A feature fireplace adds further charm, creating a cosy yet impressive focal point. \n\nThe kitchen is fully fitted with floor units, providing practical workspace while maintaining the home`s character. A short set of steps leads up to a small inner hallway, giving access to a well-appointed shower room and a neatly concealed utility area.\n\nAbove, a loft-style bedroom is accessed via elegant stairs with brass framing, offering a distinctive and stylish sleeping space along with additional attic eave storage. \n\nTo the rear, the property boasts a private, south-facing garden, a true sun trap and designed for low maintenance, making it ideal for relaxing or entertaining. \n\n8 Rutland Cottages presents a rare opportunity to acquire a home full of personality in a convenient and well-connected location.\n\nFor viewing information please email sales@kmproperty.ie."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "KITCHEN/LIVING/DINING ROOM - 4.39m (14'5\") x 5.79m (19'0\")\nSpacious living and dining room, complete with a striking double-height ceiling\n\nINNER HALLWAY\nWith utilities\n\nSHOWER ROOM - 1.45m (4'9\") x 1.86m (6'1\")\nWith shower, WC & WHB\n\nBEDROOM - 4.22m (13'10\") x 4.39m (14'5\")\nAt mezzanine level, with velux windows and eave storage\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
